Subject: [PATCH] Add Y2JB core update feature via UI and backend

Introduced a new button in the UI to update the Y2JB core (lapse.js) file. Added a corresponding backend endpoint (/update_y2jb) in server.py to fetch the latest lapse.js from GitHub and save it to the payload directory. Implemented frontend logic in index.js to handle the update process and provide user feedback.
